---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { floridaPages } from '../../data/floridaPages';
---
<SiteLayout title="Florida Health Insurance Guides" description="Clear Florida health coverage guidance for job loss, Medicaid loss, turning 26, COBRA, self-employment and Special Enrollment Periods." funnelContext="general">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Florida coverage paths</p><h1>Health insurance guidance for the change you are facing.</h1><p>Start with your situation. Get the important deadline, understand the main choices and request licensed help only when you are ready.</p><div class="hero-actions"><button class="button" type="button" data-funnel-open data-analytics="florida_hub_cta">Check My Options</button><a class="button secondary" href="/florida/aca-subsidy-calculator/">Estimate income level</a></div></div><aside class="path-card"><p class="eyebrow">Know before you start</p><div class="path-step"><span class="path-num">✓</span><div><strong>Florida uses HealthCare.gov</strong><span>The federal Marketplace handles ACA enrollment.</span></div></div><div class="path-step"><span class="path-num">✓</span><div><strong>Life-event proof may be required</strong><span>Keep notices showing the event and date.</span></div></div><div class="path-step"><span class="path-num">✓</span><div><strong>Income means the full year</strong><span>Earlier wages can still count after a job loss.</span></div></div></aside></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Choose your guide</p><h2>Coverage answers organized by intent</h2></div><div class="grid-3">{floridaPages.map((page) => <a class="card link-card" href={`/florida/${page.slug}/`}><h3>{page.title.replace(' in Florida','').replace('Florida: ','')}</h3><p>{page.cardSummary}</p><span class="link-arrow">Read guide →</span></a>)}<a class="card link-card" href="/florida/aca-subsidy-calculator/"><h3>ACA income & FPL estimator</h3><p>Estimate your federal poverty level percentage before using the official Marketplace.</p><span class="link-arrow">Use estimator →</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section tint"><div class="narrow"><div class="callout warning"><strong>Use HealthCare.gov for an official decision.</strong><p>HealthCoveragePath provides education and a request for licensed help. It does not determine eligibility or enroll you in coverage.</p></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
